{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13105130","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13105130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1310513001:1":{"text":"아, 또 그 몬스터에게 쫓기던 아이들이에요! 그리고 두 명의 전사가 그들을 지키고 있네요.","source_cn":"呀，又是刚才那两个被怪物追逐的小孩子！还有两个战士在保...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AD03C569017E0D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310513002:1":{"text":"그들은 악마에게 물러서지도 않고 용감하게 맞서 싸웠어요... 그 후에는 어떻게 됐을까요...? ","source_cn":"不知道后来怎么样了……他们面对恶魔也一步不退，很英勇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A3C8AD51B56C220","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310513003:1":{"text":"전사들이 악마에게서 아이들을 구했으면... 음, 물론 그들도 무사하고요!","source_cn":"要是战士们能从恶魔手中救出孩子就好了……嗯，他们自己也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98F0629EED6D090C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310513004:1":{"text":"치피는 여기에 용감한 전사들의 영혼이 많이 있다고 믿어요. 그 영혼들이 우리를 블루벨벳에게 인도해 줄 거예요!","source_cn":"满满知道这里有很多英勇战士的灵魂，希望你们的灵魂能指引...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D97ECFEBE0B9A7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310513005:1":{"text":"저희가 그 블루벨벳을 전쟁에서 희생된 영웅들에게 바칠게요. 바로 여러분에게요!","source_cn":"我们会把七瓣花献给那场战争中的英雄——献给你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E4B087CA03A5F2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}